# Falsifiability (seat G's laundering counterexample, now executable): typed evidence
# carrying a NARROWED scope with NO scopedByComputation edge must violate arm 2
# (scope-provenance gap) — the exact hole the circular round-1 letter permitted.
@prefix ciops: <https://oip.law/ontology/ci-ops#> .
ciops:ev-laundered a ciops:VerificationEvidence ;
    ciops:hasScope ciops:AffectedScope .
